[size=4][b][u]Overview[/u][/b][/size]
Starfield Record Compare Engine is a Windows desktop application for inspecting and comparing records across Starfield plugins.

The application discovers your local Starfield load order, imports supported plugin records into a local cache, and presents record differences in an easy-to-navigate comparison workspace. It is intended for mod authors and developers reviewing overrides, debugging compatibility issues, and inspecting plugin data.

[quote]
NOTE: This is an early release. Record-type support will expand over time.

Starfield must be installed on the system so the application can discover the local load order and plugin files.
[/quote]

[size=4][b][u]Features[/u][/b][/size]
[list]
[*]Discovers the local Starfield plugin load order.[/*]
[*]Imports plugin metadata and master references.[/*]
[*]Browses records owned by a selected plugin in a filterable record tree.[/*]
[*]Filters records by FormID and EditorID.[/*]
[*]Compares matching records across imported plugins in load-order order.[/*]
[*]Highlights matching values in green, conflicts in red, and the visible winning override in yellow.[/*]
[*]Preserves form-list item order and duplicate entries during comparison.[/*]
[*]Skips unchanged plugins during later imports for faster startup processing.[/*]
[*]Supports light and dark application themes.[/*]
[/list]

[size=4][b][u]Currently Supported Record Types[/u][/b][/size]
[list]
[*]Form Lists (FLST)[/*]
[*]Game Settings (GMST)[/*]
[/list]

[size=4][b][u]Planned Features[/u][/b][/size]
[list]
[*]Support additional Starfield record types.[/*]
[*]Expand record inspection and comparison workflows.[/*]
[*]Add patch creation and record editing workflows.[/*]
[/list]

[size=4][b][u]Usage[/u][/b][/size]
[list=1]
[*]Launch Starfield Record Compare Engine.[/*]
[*]Wait for the startup import to discover and process your local load order.[/*]
[*]Open a plugin from the application toolbar or File menu.[/*]
[*]Use the record tree and filters to find a supported record.[/*]
[*]Select a record to view its values across imported plugins.[/*]
[/list]

[size=4][b][u]Comparison Colors[/u][/b][/size]
[list]
[*][color=green]Green[/color]: all visible plugin values match.[/*]
[*][color=red]Red[/color]: at least one visible plugin value differs.[/*]
[*][color=yellow]Yellow[/color]: the far-right visible value is the winning override for a conflicting row.[/*]
[/list]

[size=4][b][u]Installation[/u][/b][/size]
Download the current release archive, extract it to a folder of your choice, and run the application.

This is a standalone Windows x64 desktop tool. Do not install it into your Starfield Data folder.

[size=4][b][u]Current Limitations[/u][/b][/size]
[list]
[*]The record tree currently displays only Form Lists (FLST) and Game Settings (GMST).[/*]
[*]BlueprintShips*.esm plugins are intentionally skipped during import.[/*]
[/list]

[size=4][b][u]Known Issues[/u][/b][/size]
No known issues are currently documented.

